'''''Lost Generation''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Cat Among Pigeons]].

==Steps==
# Reunite with the Crew
# Tell Aventurine what the Crew thinks
# Talk to Himeko
# Talk to March 7th
# Talk to Welt
# Recall the memories on Acheron
# Speak with Acheron
# Discuss the plan with the Crew

