===Talk to Himeko{{subst:void|<!--103100121-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Golden Hour|update|The Crew safely arrives at the Golden Hour and exchanges info with you. After an intense discussion, you decide to work with Aventurine. Before planning the next step, take some time to discuss what everyone is concerned about.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}


;(Talk to Himeko)
:{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Perhaps he's going for the Hotel?
::'''Himeko:''' An attack on the hotel guests? Unlikely. Penacony's guests include quite a few big wigs known throughout the whole cosmos, people who not even the IPC would dare take lightly. Aventurine is a shrewd merchant, and there's no way he doesn't know that.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Perhaps he's going for The Family?
::'''Himeko:''' He's definitely going for The Family, and it's just a matter of how. The Harmony is strong in Penacony and almost impossible to take on head-to-head. The fact that the IPC dispatched Aventurine shows that they do not intend to simply play by the book here.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Perhaps he's going for Acheron?
::'''Himeko:''' Aventurine has devoted considerable attention to her. But this Galaxy Ranger... we know hardly anything about her and can't rush to any conclusions.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Perhaps he's going for the Astral Express?
::'''Himeko:''' ...I was also considering this possibility, especially... because he respects you so much, and has sought you out before a few times. Perhaps he's also unsure of your intentions, and is probing you.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Выход}} No conclusions can be drawn just yet.
::'''Himeko:''' ...I'm just speculating. In any case, we have to be careful when handling Aventurine. He's skilled at reading people and discerning the right moment to strike. Also...
::{{tx}}
