===Talk to March 7th{{subst:void|<!--103100123-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}


;(Talk to Himeko)
:'''Himeko:''' If Aventurine wants to bring down The Family, he'll have to create a big enough chance. After everything he's done so far &mdash; what is his goal...?

;(Talk to March 7th)
:'''March 7th:''' I hope it's not too soon to bring it up, but I feel like... Miss Robin isn't actually dead, but that she's still alive and well somewhere. That everything's just some... horrible prank...
:'''March 7th:''' Because... aren't we supposed to be inside a dream? How could someone die in a beautiful dreamscape like this... Shouldn't only good things happen here?
:'''March 7th:''' Whenever I see the grand theater, I just can't stop all these thoughts from flooding my head...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Do you think The Family is behind all this?
::'''March 7th:''' No no, after all they've brought everyone this sleepy dreamscape which everyone loves. I just feel like I'm starting to understand them less and less...
::We'll restore all the dreams back to normal.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We'll restore all the dreams back to normal.
:'''March 7th:''' Yeah! Of course, at times like this we're so lucky to have our Crew. The Family and the IPC &mdash; everyone has their own plans going on...
:'''March 7th:''' Everyone's still having a great time out there on the streets. Nobody knows what's happened... It's all so unreal, as if Firefly, Miss Robin, and us... were all outsiders from another world.
:{{tx}}
